{"id":"f631e6ce6349072c","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-generic.md","title":"1-generic 的 c.e. 锥回避","display":"thm-generic — 1-generic 的 c.e. 锥回避","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-generic","aliases":["20-thm-generic"],"display":"thm-generic — 1-generic 的 c.e. 锥回避","chapter":"6","section":"6.3","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Exercise 6.3.5(iii)","source_printed_pages":[139],"source_pdf_pages":[173],"depends_on":["[[20-df-1gen]]","[[20-df-re]]","[[20-df-tred]]","[[20-df-oracle-numbering]]","[[20-thm-K-undecidable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-generic"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-generic</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-generic — 1-generic 的 c.e. 锥回避"},{"key":"chapter","html":"6"},{"key":"section","html":"6.3"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Exercise 6.3.5(iii)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>139</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>173</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b03a71cd282632fa\" href=\"?note=b03a71cd282632fa\" title=\"20-df-1gen\">20-df-1gen</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"60af447f5d59a8dc\" href=\"?note=60af447f5d59a8dc\" title=\"20-df-re\">20-df-re</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"52376918bee1945e\" href=\"?note=52376918bee1945e\" title=\"20-df-tred\">20-df-tred</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"140cce30ee9c16d1\" href=\"?note=140cce30ee9c16d1\" title=\"20-df-oracle-numbering\">20-df-oracle-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d18ba716e49ac8c6\" href=\"?note=d18ba716e49ac8c6\" title=\"20-thm-K-undecidable\">20-thm-K-undecidable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(G\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{1Generic}(\\chi_G)\">\\(\\operatorname{1Generic}(\\chi_G)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z\\in\\mathcal E\">\\(Z\\in\\mathcal E\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z\\le_TG\">\\(Z\\le_TG\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b03a71cd282632fa\" href=\"?note=b03a71cd282632fa\" title=\"20-df-1gen\">20-df-1gen</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"60af447f5d59a8dc\" href=\"?note=60af447f5d59a8dc\" title=\"20-df-re\">20-df-re</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"52376918bee1945e\" href=\"?note=52376918bee1945e\" title=\"20-df-tred\">20-df-tred</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"140cce30ee9c16d1\" href=\"?note=140cce30ee9c16d1\" title=\"20-df-oracle-numbering\">20-df-oracle-numbering</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"d18ba716e49ac8c6\" href=\"?note=d18ba716e49ac8c6\" title=\"20-thm-K-undecidable\">20-thm-K-undecidable</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}generic}\\vdash\nZ\\in\\mathcal R,\\qquad G\\not\\equiv_TK.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}generic}\\vdash\nZ\\in\\mathcal R,\\qquad G\\not\\equiv_TK.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi_e^G=\\chi_Z\">\\(\\Phi_e^G=\\chi_Z\\)</span>。串集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S=\\{\\sigma:\\exists x\\in Z\\ [\\Phi_e^\\sigma(x)\\downarrow=0]\\}\">\\(S=\\{\\sigma:\\exists x\\in Z\\ [\\Phi_e^\\sigma(x)\\downarrow=0]\\}\\)</span> 是 c.e.：等待枚举出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in Z\">\\(x\\in Z\\)</span> 及有限停止见证。真实 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 不碰到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>，所以有前缀 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\preceq\\chi_G\">\\(\\sigma\\preceq\\chi_G\\)</span> 的全部延伸都不在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>。于是对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span>，有</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"x\\notin Z\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists\\tau\\succeq\\sigma\\ [\\Phi_e^\\tau(x)\\downarrow=0].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[x\\notin Z\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists\\tau\\succeq\\sigma\\ [\\Phi_e^\\tau(x)\\downarrow=0].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>正向由真实全计算的有限 use 保证见证；反向由避开 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 保证。输入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span>，交错等待 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 被枚举进 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z\">\\(Z\\)</span> 或搜索到上式的零输出，两者恰有一个会发生，因此 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z\">\\(Z\\)</span> 可计算。特别地，若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\equiv_TK\">\\(G\\equiv_TK\\)</span>，则非可计算 c.e. 集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\\le_TG\">\\(K\\le_TG\\)</span>，矛盾。</p>\n<p>修订将冲突集合精确限定为“已枚举的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in Z\">\\(x\\in Z\\)</span> 与零输出冲突”。不能把阶段中尚未枚举 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 与输出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span> 视为真实冲突，因为以后 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 可能进入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z\">\\(Z\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>来源：Exercise 6.3.5(iii)；印刷页 139；PDF 第 173 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-1gen","status":"resolved","id":"b03a71cd282632fa","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-1gen]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-re","status":"resolved","id":"60af447f5d59a8dc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-re]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-tred","status":"resolved","id":"52376918bee1945e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-tred]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-oracle-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"140cce30ee9c16d1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-oracle-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-K-undecidable","status":"resolved","id":"d18ba716e49ac8c6","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-K-undecidable]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-1gen","status":"resolved","id":"b03a71cd282632fa","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-1gen]]；see [[20-df-re]]；see [[20-df-tred]]；see [[20-df-oracle-numbering]]；see [[20-thm-K-undecidable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-re","status":"resolved","id":"60af447f5d59a8dc","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-1gen]]；see [[20-df-re]]；see [[20-df-tred]]；see [[20-df-oracle-numbering]]；see [[20-thm-K-undecidable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-tred","status":"resolved","id":"52376